      "key": "agentic_packet_and_walkthrough",
      "statement": "The agentic walkthrough runs the constitutional process end-to-end on real work using declared authority: intake triage, smallest lawful re-entry, specification/requirement/design/ticket chain, constructive loop and closure proof. The packet contains input/output contract, required context, role, evaluator regime and provenance, limited to the smallest sufficient declared authority with source refs; memory and wholesale hidden context do not replace it. Conformance is enforced through artifact admission rather than enlarged agent context. Compression is prompt input, never deciding authority; general derived frames may orient precedence/re-entry/traceability but product-specific behaviour comes from the current Product packet.",
