      "grounding": [
        {
          "end_line": 1505,
          "quote": "An agent that ignored the declared authority, relied on stale memory or\nreasoned badly has produced agent error, not a method defect. Admission\nrejects the malformed artifact either way, so a bad agent turn neither\nbecomes law nor silently indicts the method (P6).",
